B.UI=new A.f2("No fatigue, illness, anxiety, sorrow or grief touches a Muslim \u2014 not even the prick of a thorn \u2014 but that Allah expiates some of his sins by it.","Sahih al-Bukhari 5641 \u2014 excerpt")
