B.aux=new A.pY("Ghunnah","The nasal sound of noon and meem \u2014 two counts, voiced through the nose, steady, not squeezed.",B.abr,"Skipping ghunnah where required is Lahn Jali \u2014 the letter is effectively changed. A thin, short ghunnah is Lahn Khafi.","Tuhfat al-Atfal, verse 19")
